{"reviews":[{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-0","r":2.0,"t":"Product needs more transparent labeling","x":"The name of the company \u201cPure Organic Ingredients\u201d led me to assume this product was organic. That seems pretty misleading? I also can\u2019t tell if it contains sesame oil or not. There is conflicting information in the product description online and unfortunately the bottle does not list the ingredients. I\u2019m using this item for an herbal tincture that will be taken internally so I\u2019d really like to know if it contains sesame since we have a sesame allergy in my family.","h":87,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Main Ingredient for e-juice","x":"The product is great for no throaty irritation when vaping.","h":70,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Not using it for what you think..","x":"I have not used it yet but I'm not using it for my skin.Im using it for my acrylic painting.. its supposed to help the paint slide better on the canvas and help keep the paint from drying up so quickly...It helps with blending colors better too..Yes I know my review is a bit different from what I'm sure your looking for..But this is the purpose for me using this product...","h":51,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Make your own kids bubbles","x":"Use this product with water and ordinary dish soap and you have real bubbles!","h":49,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-4","r":1.0,"t":"This is NOT ORGANIC GLYCERIN","x":"I'm feeling cheated. THIS IS NOT ORGANIC GLYCERIN! I would think that a product that  is labeled PURE ORGANIC INGREDIENTS would need to be actually ORGANIC. I actually only figured it out that IT IS NOT ORGANIC  by searching through the community questions. Totally deceptive.","h":27,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Oh the uses for glycerin","x":"This bottle I bought to put a scant teaspoon into my home made ice cream to keep it from forming ice crystals after storing in the freezer.  I just bought a Cuisinart Ice Cream Machine and followed a simple recipe for chocolate ice cream, but I wanted to make sure that it would not become hard and full of ice crystals once I stored it in the freezer, so I did some research online and glycerin is one of several ways to keep ice cream creamy.  It only takes a teaspoon in the recipe and the other t","h":24,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-6","r":4.0,"t":"Will buy again","x":"Will buy again! I use it as moisturizer and put it straight on my face.","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"As described. Bought this to use in my DIY Vitamin C Serum.","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-8","r":1.0,"t":"NOT ORGANIC!!","x":"Theres nothing worse than Deceptive Advertising! There's NOTHING Organic about this product! The company's name has \"Organic\" in the name itself, Not Organic ingredients in their products.  Boycott this company!","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great for DIY Personal Care Products!","x":"Good product. I use in making my own personal care products like foaming and regular hand soap, body wash. It helps to thicken the product and serves as an additional moisturizer.","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-10","r":5.0,"t":"Keeps homemade ice cream soft","x":"I use this as an ingredient to keep my homemade ice cream soft in the freezer - even after a week or more!","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-11","r":1.0,"t":"Many of us have serious food allergies and would be useful to know such info","x":"Maybe if the company lists the ingredients, more of us would buy. Many of us have serious food allergies and would be useful to know such info. Thanks.","h":14,"v":0,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Good product","x":"Great product!  I am on my second bottle.  I use it nightly on my feet and I must say they are very soft as a result of using this product.  Highly recommend!","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-13","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I was using Thayers Rose witch hazel for years and discovered this.  FABULOUS!!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I was using Thayers Rose witch hazel for years and discovered this.  FABULOUS!!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-15","r":1.0,"t":"Bogus product NOT ORGANIC as in description","x":"My product does not say organic as promised","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-16","r":5.0,"t":"DIY Makeup Setting Spray hack","x":"Good price for the amount of product. I have been using in a DIY makeup setting spray and it works just like it's supposed to.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-17","r":5.0,"t":"I use this to make my vape juice.","x":"I use this to make my vape juice. This is one of the best glycerin products I have found a good clean flavor and also great in several crafting projects as I am an avid card maker and scrapbooking. So many uses and I always come back to this brand and also very prompt shipping and always impeccably packed so I will continue to buy. No complaints  just as described and pure.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-18","r":1.0,"t":"Shady marketing","x":"So they tricked ya! Marketing has their company PURE ORGANIC INGREDIENTS in huge font in the front u see vegetable glycerin so you think you\u2019re buying organic glycerin. When I got it I saw that it was not organic. Great! 0 stars for you for being shady.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Love this stuff","x":"Amazing for your skin immediately noticed a difference. safe for people who have folliculitis..","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-20","r":5.0,"t":"this is a really great, I meant awesome product and I highly recommend ...","x":"this product really work in absorbing in moister from the air and withing your skin. this is a really great, I meant awesome product and I highly recommend this product  for anyone with dry, or hands that crack and tend to bleed then this is for you.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great glycerin!","x":"I\u2019ve used this glycerine several times for herbal tinctures and it\u2019s perfect. The quality, the taste and the company are great. I highly recommend this to anyone.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-22","r":1.0,"t":"Not Quite What I Expected","x":"The amazon pictures, as well as the other reviews of this product, led me to believe that it would be in a transparent bottle, but instead, what I got was this sort of dark brown bottle that was already open and seeping vegetable glycerin everywhere. How do I receive a refund or at least a replacement bottle since what I received is less than half a bottle of what I paid for and a mess of spilled glycerin to clean up alongside it.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-23","r":5.0,"t":"I was pleased with the speedy delivery as I was making giant ...","x":"I was pleased with the speedy delivery as I was making giant bubbles with our church youth group and could not find glycerin\u200b in the grocery stores.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B0B96MFXSJ-24","r":1.0,"t":"NOT ORGANIC - intentionally misleading","x":"MISLEADING LABELING PRODUCT IS ***NOT ORGANIC****","h":7,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the product's versatility, using it for DIY personal care, skincare, homemade ice cream, bubbles, and even acrylic painting.","cites":[3,4,6,7,8,10,11,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers are upset that the product is not actually organic despite the company name 'Pure Organic Ingredients,' calling it misleading or deceptive.","cites":[1,5,9]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain about missing or unclear ingredient labeling, including allergy concerns and conflicting online information.","cites":[1,12]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers report success using it as a moisturizer for skin and feet, noting softness.","cites":[7,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers use it as an ingredient to keep homemade ice cream soft and free of ice crystals.","cites":[6,11]}]},"qa":[]}